@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About | Enable Dev Mode</PageTitle>

<Section Spacing="SectionSpacing.Lg">
    <Column Gap="14" MaxWidth="Length.Prose">
        <Column Gap="8">
            <Row Gap="5" Align="Align.Center">
                @* The photo falls back to initials if it fails to load. *@
                <Avatar Src="images/izzy.jpg" Name="Izzy Dryer" Size="AvatarSize.Xl2" />
                <Column Gap="2">
                    <Heading Level="1" Size="TextSize.Xl4" MinSize="TextSize.Xl3">Hi, I'm Izzy</Heading>
                    <TextBlock Size="TextSize.Lg" Color="Color.Muted">Software developer and the person behind Enable Dev Mode.</TextBlock>
                </Column>
            </Row>
            <Column Gap="4">
                <TextBlock>I'm a software developer who works mostly in Angular, with Python and C# along the way, and I've
                    built software for accounting and warehousing teams.</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock>Right now I'm building with Blazor and .NET. The main piece is <Anchor Href="@SiteLinks.IzzyBlazor" External>IzzyBlazor</Anchor>,
                    a component library for Blazor's static server rendering. This site runs on it, so every rough edge I hit here
                    goes back into the library.</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock>Every other Thursday I send <Anchor Href="/roundup">The Blazor Roundup</Anchor>: what shipped in Blazor and
                    .NET, and what to do about it. It's the reading I'd be doing anyway, sorted and checked.</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock>Tutorials and project videos will come, but not on a schedule. They'll grow out of what I'm building, once
                    there's something worth teaching.</TextBlock>
            </Column>
        </Column>

        <Column Gap="5">
            <Heading Level="2" Size="TextSize.Xl2">What you'll find here</Heading>
            <DescriptionList Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" Divided>
                <DescriptionItem Term="The Blazor Roundup">Releases, security patches, component libraries and the best articles, every other Thursday.</DescriptionItem>
                <DescriptionItem Term="IzzyBlazor">The component library this site is built with, in alpha. Each Roundup notes what changed.</DescriptionItem>
                @if (ProjectCatalog.HasPublished)
                {
                    <DescriptionItem Term="Projects">Apps I've built, with the video, the lessons and the code.</DescriptionItem>
                }
                else
                {
                    <DescriptionItem Term="Videos">Later, as the projects take shape. The Roundup will say when the first one is out.</DescriptionItem>
                }
            </DescriptionList>
        </Column>

        <Column Gap="5">
            <Heading Level="2" Size="TextSize.Xl2">Get in touch</Heading>
            <Row Gap="3" Wrap>
                <LinkButton Href="@SiteLinks.EmailHref" Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Accent="Accent.Neutral" StartIcon="Lucide.Mail">@SiteLinks.Email</LinkButton>
                <LinkButton Href="@SiteLinks.YouTube" External Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Accent="Accent.Neutral" StartIcon="Brands.YouTube">YouTube</LinkButton>
                <LinkButton Href="@SiteLinks.GitHub" External Variant="ButtonVariant.Outline" Accent="Accent.Neutral" StartIcon="Brands.GitHub">GitHub</LinkButton>
            </Row>
        </Column>
    </Column>
</Section>

<NewsletterBand FormName="signup-about" Source="about" />
